### ==================== AI 翻译官 接口调试 ====================
### 默认端口 8080

### 翻译（新格式：sourceLang / targetLang，支持多语言）
POST http://localhost:8080/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "你好，世界",
  "sourceLang": "zh",
  "targetLang": "en"
}

### 翻译（自动检测源语言）
POST http://localhost:8080/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello, how are you?",
  "sourceLang": "auto",
  "targetLang": "zh"
}

### 翻译（兼容旧版 direction 参数）
POST http://localhost:8080/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "你好，世界",
  "direction": "zh2en"
}

### 查词（列出单词全部义项，一词多义全部列出）
POST http://localhost:8080/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "casual",
  "sourceLang": "auto",
  "targetLang": "zh",
  "mode": "dictionary"
}

### 获取支持的语言列表
GET http://localhost:8080/languages

### 读取当前配置（API Key 打码）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/config

### 更新配置（apiKey 留空则保持不变）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "",
  "model": "deepseek-chat",
  "apiUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1/chat/completions"
}
